{"slug":"justin-verlander-kate-upton-expressing-themselves-by-violating-fans-giving-them-the-bird","postId":75322,"title":"Justin Verlander & Kate Upton Expressing Themselves By Violating Fans Giving Them The Bird","htmlContent":"<!-- wp:image {\"id\":519817,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/rawImage-2-1024x735.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-519817\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Kate Upton laughs with her husband Houston Astros starting pitcher Justin Verlander (35) after the Astros won Game 5 of the American League Division Series at Minute Maid Park in Houston, on Thursday, Oct. 10, 2019.</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Even the fans trolling about his wife's supermodel couldn't shake Justin Verlander, who helped the Astros defeat the Phillies 3-2 in World Series Game 5 last week.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Phillies fans were <a href=\"https://twitter.com/CaseMcGase/status/1588315064972759040?s=20&amp;t=81fjWLqbe0jR36fL3Rn1og\">ruthless in chanting</a> \"Where's Kate Upton,\" according to an attending fan like Verlander warmed up before the game at Citizens Bank Park in Philadelphia.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Upton, who was wearing an orange sweater, was seen all smiling while cheering and clapping in his seat.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Also during game five Upton got into a back with a Philly fan where she can be seen on video featured on social media throughout the weekend.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/_thathouguy/status/1588955057684611073?s=20u0026t=Up_pJKoOJL1-gCs4jxY0Ew\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/_thathouguy/status/1588955057684611073?s=20&amp;t=Up_pJKoOJL1-gCs4jxY0Ew\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Her exaggerated and mocking facial expression directly in the twin birds is invaluable.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Apparently, Kate and Justin enjoy speaking with their fingers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Getting off the Astros bus before Game 3 in Philadelphia, Verlander saluted the Phillies fans with the big one.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/DanClarkSports/status/1587181464105275392?s=20u0026t=UVIRVCbrvcdpA3wD7K3-Yg\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/DanClarkSports/status/1587181464105275392?s=20&amp;t=UVIRVCbrvcdpA3wD7K3-Yg\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/darren04/status/1587160265447161857?s=20u0026t=N4anbIvMkeLyOjuWw5LqvA\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/darren04/status/1587160265447161857?s=20&amp;t=N4anbIvMkeLyOjuWw5LqvA\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->","excerpt":"Kate Upton laughs with her husband Houston Astros starting pitcher Justin Verlander (35) after the Astros won Game 5 of the American League Division Series at Minute Maid Park in Houston, on…","publishedAt":"2022-11-05T05:00:00Z","modifiedAt":"2022-11-05T05:00:00Z","author":{"slug":"tony-mcknight","displayName":"Tony McKnight"},"categories":[{"slug":"sports","name":"Sports"}],"tags":[{"slug":"byron-nelson","name":"Byron Nelson"},{"slug":"houston-astros","name":"Houston Astros"},{"slug":"justin-verlander","name":"Justin Verlander"},{"slug":"kate-upton","name":"Kate Upton"},{"slug":"landon-buford","name":"Landon Buford"},{"slug":"mlb","name":"MLB"},{"slug":"phillies","name":"Phillies"}],"heroImage":{"originalUrl":"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/rawImage-2-1024x735.jpg"},"inlineImageUrls":["http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/rawImage-2-1024x735.jpg"],"readingTimeMin":1,"type":"post","link":"https://landonbuford.com/justin-verlander-kate-upton-expressing-themselves-by-violating-fans-giving-them-the-bird/"}